## BMAD Development & Documentation Flow

{{#if (includes skills "bmad")}}
> **BMAD Status: INSTALLED & ACTIVE** — The `bmad` skill is configured for this project. Load `use skill bmad` at the start of every development, bugfix, or documentation workflow and run the BMAD scale-adaptive context & documentation flow below (composing with any companion `bmad-*` skills if present).
