> **Conditional Skill Detection:** Before starting any development or documentation task, check whether the `bmad` skill (or companion `bmad-*` skills / `_bmad/` directory) is installed in your available skills or skill directory. **If the `bmad` skill is installed, load `use skill bmad` and execute the BMAD flow below. If `bmad` is NOT installed, skip BMAD-specific artifacts and run the standard pipeline.**
